<Base title="Practices" description="Seven practices, one team: web design, managed hosting, cloud and containers, AI, compliance readiness, consultancy, staffing and talent.">
<section><div class="container">
<p class="eyebrow">Practices</p>
<h1>Seven practices. Each one stands alone.</h1>
<p class="lead">Your technology, designed, built and run by one team. Buy one practice, buy all seven — none requires the others.</p>
<div class="grid3"><div class="card silo"><h3>Web Design & Experience</h3><p class="plain">Websites, stores and apps people love to use — and you can edit yourself.</p><p class="tech">Built on WordPress — 38.6% of the web (W3Techs, Nov 2026).</p><p><a href={BASE + "/services/web-design"}>Web Design</a>, <a href={BASE + "/services/ux-design"}>UX Design</a>, <a href={BASE + "/services/website-builder"}>Website Builder</a>, <a href={BASE + "/services/no-code-app-builder"}>No-Code App Builder</a>, <a href={BASE + "/services/ecommerce"}>eCommerce Setup</a></p><a href={BASE + "/practices/web-design-experience"}>Explore Web Design & Experience →</a></div>
<div class="card silo"><h3>Managed Hosting</h3><p class="plain">Hosting that just works — set up, secured, backed up and watched.</p><p class="tech">Daily backups, SSL and monitoring. You never touch a server.</p><p><a href={BASE + "/services/managed-wordpress"}>Managed WordPress Hosting</a>, <a href={BASE + "/services/vps-hosting"}>Managed VPS Hosting</a>, <a href={BASE + "/services/dedicated-hosting"}>Dedicated Server Hosting</a></p><a href={BASE + "/practices/managed-hosting"}>Explore Managed Hosting →</a></div>
<div class="card silo"><h3>Cloud & Containers</h3><p class="plain">Cloud, Kubernetes and OpenShift, run for you.</p><p class="tech">Managed clusters, upgrades and monitoring included.</p><p><a href={BASE + "/services/cloud-infrastructure"}>Cloud & Infrastructure</a>, <a href={BASE + "/services/kubernetes"}>Managed Kubernetes</a>, <a href={BASE + "/services/openshift"}>Managed OpenShift</a>, <a href={BASE + "/services/managed-containers"}>Managed Container Hosting</a></p><a href={BASE + "/practices/cloud-containers"}>Explore Cloud & Containers →</a></div>
<div class="card silo"><h3>AI</h3><p class="plain">Practical AI in the tools you already use.</p><p class="tech">Data boundaries checked first. No hype, no data leaks.</p><p><a href={BASE + "/services/ai-consulting"}>AI Consulting</a></p><a href={BASE + "/practices/ai"}>Explore AI →</a></div>
<div class="card silo"><h3>Compliance Readiness</h3><p class="plain">Cloud set up to meet HIPAA, PCI DSS and SOC 2 — readiness, not certification.</p><p class="tech">Gap review + landing zone + audit evidence pack.</p><p><a href={BASE + "/services/compliance-readiness"}>Compliance Readiness</a></p><a href={BASE + "/practices/compliance-readiness"}>Explore Compliance Readiness →</a></div>
<div class="card silo"><h3>Consultancy</h3><p class="plain">A clear plan before you spend.</p><p class="tech">Architecture, vendors and roadmap, in writing.</p><p><a href={BASE + "/services/consultancy"}>Technology Consultancy</a></p><a href={BASE + "/practices/consultancy"}>Explore Consultancy →</a></div>
<div class="card silo"><h3>Staffing & Talent</h3><p class="plain">Specialists matched in days, embedded in your team.</p><p class="tech">Project-based. No long contract, no hiring overhead.</p><p><a href={BASE + "/services/staffing"}>Design & Developer Staffing</a>, <a href={BASE + "/services/talent-marketplace"}>Talent Marketplace</a></p><a href={BASE + "/practices/staffing-talent"}>Explore Staffing & Talent →</a></div>
</div>
<p style="margin-top:32px"><a class="btn" href={BASE + "/contact"}>Contact us →</a></p>
</div></section>
